          "title": "PlaySight, Microsoft create generative AI analysis tool for pickleball",
          "summary": "PlaySight and Microsoft unveiled InSight AI, a generative AI analytics tool for pickleball designed to deliver advanced match analysis, coaching insights, and player performance suggestions in real time.",
