        },
        {
          "title": "StubHub launches AI tool for rightsholders",
          "summary": "StubHub released the Distribution Manager, an AI-powered tool to automate ticket management for rights holders across sports and entertainment, streamlining ticket inventory and revenue operations.",
          "source": "https://www.sportsbusinessjournal.com/Articles/2026/03/18/stubhub-launches-ai-tool-for-rightsholders/",
