        },
        {
          "title": "Wall Street ends higher as traders return to AI stocks",
          "summary": "Wall Street rose on Monday as investors rotated into AI-related equities, with tech names leading the gains. The rally was driven by enthusiasm around artificial intelligence deployment and its impact on earnings prospects, with AI-related stocks contributing to a broader tech-led rebound and market optimism.",
          "source": "https://www.reuters.com/business/wall-st-stocks-ai-stocks-2026-03-16/",
          "signature": "c1adcfd9134304bd089f814da53bf2af5975ac275349ce160f6cd0dbe61420d6"
        },
        {
          "title": "Analysts revise AI hyperscaler debt forecasts after Amazon bond sale",
          "summary": "Analysts raised expectations for AI hyperscaler debt issuance following Amazon's bond sale, with Bank of America increasing its 2026 debt forecast for hyperscalers to about $175 billion. The report underscores growing financing demand to support AI infrastructure and cloud-scale computing capacity.",
          "source": "https://www.reuters.com/business/retail-consumer/analysts-revise-ai-hyperscaler-debt-forecasts-after-amazon-bond-sale-2026-03-17/",
